# Astra: the desktop Kosmos has had all along - the Deskbar across the top,
# the dock, the launcher pad, your files behind everything.
#
# A desktop is a file (`docs/pewter.md`, agreed 7 November 2026): which
# programs make it up, started by the window manager in this order when it
# is chosen. The window manager is the same one under every desktop; what
# differs is what it starts and, as Pewter is built, how it draws.
#
#   name        what the chooser calls it
#   says        a line under the name
#   shell       the programs that are the desktop, in order, as `wm` takes
#               them: a name, or a name and its words after a colon
#   background  those of them that open no window when they start, and are
#               ready as soon as they are running

name       = Astra
says       = The Deskbar, the dock and the launcher pad
shell      = notifications, desktop, deskbar
background = notifications
